# EFI artifacts
/*.efi
/build/efi/

# stdlib.zip + its .sig are rebuilt+resigned from mods/py/stdlib_src/ on
# every build (scripts/build.d/port/efi/embed-stdlib.sh) and baked into the
# firmware image as generated C byte arrays — see docs/MICROPYTHON.md. The
# .sig is never byte-stable across re-signs, so none of this is tracked.
/mods/py/stdlib.zip
/mods/py/stdlib.zip.sig
/src/pymergetic/metal/py/py_zip_embed.inc.c


# wamrc temp stack-usage dumps (cwd leftovers)
wamrc-su-*.su
